29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1007","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,61,73,70,72,62],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"100","reputation":"9500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1020005","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1008","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,61,73,70,72,62],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"100","reputation":"9500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1020005","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1008","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,61,73,70,72,62],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1020005","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10162","city":"CS1008","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,61,73,70,72,62],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1020005","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1001460","name":{"zh":"白马巾帼","en":"Heroine on a White Horse"},"year":"199","month":"10","desc":{"zh":"公孙瓒死后，公孙玥继续在北疆率领少量白马义从抗击胡人......\n\n禁忌条件：主角为公孙玥、阎柔、田畴时无法触发。\n\n亲历条件：【公孙玥、阎柔、田畴存活，公孙瓒、刘虞死亡】，【公孙玥为在野状态】，【与公孙玥的关系等级至少为3级】，【与田畴的关系等级小于2级】，【与阎柔的关系等级小于2级或主角为曹操】。\n\n逆天改命：【收公孙玥、阎柔、田畴为家将】","en":"Following Gongsun Zan's death, Gongsun Yue continues to lead a small band of White Horse Volunteers on the northern frontier to resist the Hu barbarians...\n\n\n\nIncompatible Conditions: Cannot trigger if the protagonist is Gongsun Yue, Yan Rou, or Tian Chou.\n\n\n\nParticipation Requirements: 【Gongsun Yue, Yan Rou, and Tian Chou are alive, Gongsun Zan and Liu Yu are dead】, 【Gongsun Yue is Free】, 【Relationship level with Gongsun Yue is at least Level 3】, 【Relationship level with Tian Chou is below Level 2】, 【Relationship level with Yan Rou is below Level 2, or the protagonist is Cao Cao】.\n\n\n\nDefy Fate: 【Recruit Gongsun Yue, Yan Rou, and Tian Chou as Retainers】"}}],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏名将，年少时被乌丸俘虏，并逐渐在内部站稳脚跟，取得了乌丸的信任。刘虞死后，阎柔被鲜于辅等人推举为乌桓司马，联系乌桓、鲜卑为刘虞报仇，和公孙瓒对抗。袁绍死后，余党逃至辽东，阎柔借势投靠曹操，助其平定乌丸。阎柔归附后深受曹操信赖，曹操待其如子，曹丕也视其如亲兄弟。曹丕继位后，受封度辽将军。","tc":"曹魏名將，年少時被烏丸俘虜，并逐漸在內部站穩腳跟，取得了烏丸的信任。劉虞死后，閻柔被鮮于輔等人推舉為烏桓司馬，聯系烏桓、鮮卑為劉虞報仇，和公孫瓚對抗。袁紹死后，余黨逃至遼東，閻柔借勢投靠曹操，助其平定烏丸。閻柔歸附后深受曹操信賴，曹操待其如子，曹丕也視其如親兄弟。曹丕繼位后，受封度遼將軍。","en":"A renowned general of Cao Wei. Captured by the Wuhuan as a youth, he gradually established himself within their ranks and earned their trust. After Liu Yu's death, Yan Rou was nominated by Xianyu Fu and others as Major of the Wuhuan, rallying the Wuhuan and Xianbei to avenge Liu Yu and fight against Gongsun Zan. After Yuan Shao's death, when remnant forces fled to Liaodong, Yan Rou seized the opportunity to pledge allegiance to Cao Cao and helped pacify the Wuhuan. After his submission, Yan Rou enjoyed Cao Cao's deep trust. Cao Cao treated him as a son, and Cao Pi regarded him as a brother. After Cao Pi's accession, he was enfeoffed as General Who Crosses the Liao.","jp":"曹魏の名将。若くして烏丸の捕虜となったが、次第に内部で地歩を固め、烏丸の信頼を勝ち取った。劉虞の死後、閻柔は鮮于輔らに推挙されて烏桓司馬となり、烏桓や鮮卑と連携して劉虞の仇を討つべく公孫瓚に対抗した。袁紹の死後、残党が遼東へと逃亡すると、閻柔はこの機に乗じて曹操に帰順し、烏丸の平定に貢献した。帰順後の閻柔は曹操から深く信頼されて我が子のように遇され、曹丕からも実の兄弟のように親しまれた。曹丕が帝位に即くと、度遼将軍に封じられた。","kr":"조위의 명장. 어린 시절 오환에 포로로 잡혔으나 점차 내부에서 입지를 굳히며 오환의 신임을 얻었다. 유우가 죽은 뒤 선우보 등에게 추대되어 오환사마가 되었고, 오환 및 선비와 손을 잡고 유우의 원수를 갚고자 공손찬에게 대항했다. 원소가 죽은 뒤 잔당들이 요동으로 달아나자, 염유는 시세를 살펴 조조에게 귀부하여 오환 평정을 도왔다. 염유는 귀순한 뒤 조조의 두터운 신임을 받았는데, 조조는 그를 친자식처럼 아꼈고 조비 역시 친형제처럼 여겼다. 조비가 제위에 오른 뒤 도료장군에 봉해졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10313","remark":"","surname":"阎","surnameTc":"閻","surnameEn":"Yan","surnameJp":"閻","surnameKr":"염","surnameOther":"","name":"柔","nameTc":"柔","nameEn":"Rou","nameJp":"柔","nameKr":"유","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"阎柔","power":"WJ10162","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"189","city":"CS1008","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"61","wise":"73","politics":"70","charm":"72","will":"62","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"18/18/18/58/18/49/50/18","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"7800","battleSoulPoint":"5700","debateSoulPoint":"5300","strategy":"","strategy2":"1008401;1001215","professions":"0/0/4/3/0/0/2/2/1/2/0/2/0/1/0/1/2/1/3/1/1/0/3/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"26","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5800","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"7","birth":"168","show":"189","death":"227","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1020005","treasure":"","horse":"WP29001","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;9/1;13/1;30/1;33/1;45/1;43/1;31/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"曹魏名将，年少时被乌丸俘虏，并逐渐在内部站稳脚跟，取得了乌丸的信任。刘虞死后，阎柔被鲜于辅等人推举为乌桓司马，联系乌桓、鲜卑为刘虞报仇，和公孙瓒对抗。袁绍死后，余党逃至辽东，阎柔借势投靠曹操，助其平定乌丸。阎柔归附后深受曹操信赖，曹操待其如子，曹丕也视其如亲兄弟。曹丕继位后，受封度辽将